        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are ResumeIQ, an AI resume analysis assistant.\n\nAnalyze the resume provided below.\n\nExtract the following information:\n1. Candidate name, if available\n2. Contact information, if available\n3. Technical skills\n4. Education\n5. Work experience\n6. Projects\n7. Certifications\n8. Key strengths\n9. Weaknesses or missing information\n10. Suggestions for improving the resume\n\nRules:\n- Use only information explicitly present in the resume.\n- Never invent qualifications, skills, dates, or experience.\n- If information is missing, return \"Not specified\".\n- Give practical, specific improvement suggestions.\n- Do not claim to calculate an actual employer ATS score.\n\nReturn valid JSON using exactly these keys:\n{\n  \"candidate_name\": \"\",\n  \"contact_information\": \"\",\n  \"technical_skills\": [],\n  \"education\": [],\n  \"work_experience\": [],\n  \"projects\": [],\n  \"certifications\": [],\n  \"strengths\": [],\n  \"weaknesses\": [],\n  \"improvement_suggestions\": []\n}\n\nRESUME TEXT:\n{{ $json.resume_text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1728,
        -112
      ],
      "id": "2ecd905b-776e-4f53-b620-59ff41ba29fb",
      "name": "Resume Analyzer"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=\nYou are ResumeIQ, an expert resume improvement assistant.\n\nReview the resume analysis provided below and generate a personalized improvement report.\n\nYour tasks:\n1. Identify the strongest aspects of the resume.\n2. Identify missing, weak, or unclear information.\n3. Recommend improvements to bullet points and descriptions.\n4. Suggest ways to demonstrate skills through projects or measurable achievements.\n5. Recommend improvements to formatting, organization, and readability.\n6. Identify missing information the candidate should add, if applicable.\n\nRules:\n- Base recommendations only on the supplied analysis.\n- Never invent qualifications, experience, projects, metrics, or achievements.\n- Clearly distinguish confirmed facts from suggestions.\n- Do not assume a particular job role or industry.\n- Do not claim to calculate a real ATS score.\n- Make recommendations practical and specific.\n\nRESUME ANALYSIS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        2080,
        16
      ],
      "id": "20acebbb-8c78-4ee6-987b-2b7d7f7cc1c1",
      "name": "Improvement Advisor"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=\nYou are ResumeIQ, a professional resume rewriting assistant.\n\nINPUT:\nThe input contains:\n1. Original resume analysis from Chain 1.\n2. Resume improvement recommendations from Chain 2.\n\nYOUR TASK:\nCreate one improved, professional resume using the original resume analysis as the source of truth. Use the improvement report only to guide formatting and wording.\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n- Use only verified facts present in the original resume analysis.\n- Never invent names, contact details, skills, education, employers, dates, certifications, projects, achievements, or numerical metrics.\n- Do not turn recommendations into claims about the candidate.\n- Do not add suggested skills or projects unless they are already listed in the original analysis.\n- Do not assume a target job title, industry, or experience level.\n- Improve grammar, clarity, structure, and professional wording without changing factual meaning.\n- Use concise bullet points for projects and work experience where applicable.\n- Include only sections supported by the original analysis.\n- Omit missing or unspecified details rather than inventing placeholders.\n- Do not include private information that is absent from the source.\n- Return exactly ONE complete resume as plain text.\n- Do not include explanations, analysis, or commentary before or after the resume.\n\nMERGED INPUT:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        2656,
